  "instructions": [
    "Combine the oats, cranberries, and kale in a bowl. Mix the water and sodium alginate in a separate container. Add the sugar to the water mixture and stir until dissolved. Spherify the water mixture using a syringe and then add it to the oat mixture. Drizzle the coconut milk and cranberry juice over the top. Sprinkle with sea salt and butter. Drizzle with honey. Serve immediately."
